  "body": "* Double-height high ceilings\r\n* Dual kitchens for versatility\r\n* Cosy built-in fireplace\r\n* 10-Year Build Guarantee\r\n* Prime Millwater location\r\n\r\nIntroducing an exceptional brand-new residence that sets a new benchmark for contemporary comfort, style, and spacious family living. Nestled on an expansive 507sqm (approx.) section, this property boasts a generous 332sqm (approx.) floor area, with every detail crafted to elevate daily life.\r\n\r\nUpon entry, you'll be captivated by its grandeur: soaring double-height ceilings and ground-floor floor-to-ceiling windows that flood the home with natural light, blending indoor comfort with outdoor beauty. Designed for family living, it features three master bedrooms-each a private sanctuary-ensuring space and privacy for all household members and visitors.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor balances functionality and style, starting with a dedicated guest master bedroom for extended family or visitors. At its heart is a sun-drenched open-plan living and dining area, anchored by a stunning black designer kitchen with sleek cabinetry, ample storage, and a large island-perfect for casual meals or entertaining. A fully equipped second kitchen adds versatility for large gatherings or busy routines.\r\n\r\nThe living area, with a stylish built-in fireplace for cosy ambiance, connects via sliding glass doors to a sun-soaked deck-ideal for barbecues or quiet mornings. A separate ground-floor toilet adds everyday convenience for residents and guests.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the main master bedroom offers elevated views, a spacious walk-in wardrobe, and a sleek ensuite with a bathtub for private relaxation. A third master bedroom also includes an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. Two more spacious bedrooms share a well-designed bathroom, while a bright study nook provides a quiet work space. An upstairs lounge adds versatility as a media room or relaxation area.\r\n\r\nLocated in the sought-after Millwater community, it offers the perfect balance of lifestyle and convenience-close to top schools, parks, motorways, Silverdale Shopping Centre, and Orewa Beach, ideal for embracing the Kiwi coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nBacked by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, this home is a quality investment in your family's future. Opportunities for such a well-designed, spacious residence are rare-don't miss your chance to secure your dream home.\r\n\r\nPlease contact Team Vinson and Amy on 0225717074 for further information. For more information, and find all you need please visit https://www.vinsonamyandco.nz\r\n\r\nTo view/download the property files please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/WQGY",
